[44.590658, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.272095ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.441646ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.43471ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.351604ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[44.592339, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ branch selection uses exact tags or stack IDs, not names or dependencies \u001b[90m(0.196321ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ external dependents block teardown without being selected \u001b[90m(0.333051ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[44.592816, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ deletion ordering handles shuffled graphs and shared dependencies without mutation \u001b[90m(0.89915ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ dependency cycles fail planning before any deletion \u001b[90m(0.792856ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ an already torn down branch has an empty plan \u001b[90m(0.491695ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
